//		- michael Nov 18 1990
//
//	Eliminated becomeDestruct()
//		- michael Dec  4 1990
//	Finally removed Aug 21 1991 - ech
//
//	Removed PRIVATE_PROTECTED_KLUDGE
//		- ech Nov 18 1990
//
//	Rearranged and added comments for automatic documentation generating
